# Dictionary data licences

**The dictionary data in this directory is NOT covered by the repository's
Apache License, Version 2.0.** Each source keeps its original terms. The
compiled artifacts built from it — `dictionary/output/dictionary.bin`,
`dictionary.fst`, `association.bin`, `syllables.fst`, and the copies staged
into every application package — merge all of these sources into one index and
are **not separable** back into per-source rows.

Anyone redistributing this repository, or any application package built from
it, must satisfy every row below. `dictionary/docs/SOURCES.md` carries
publisher, origin URL, capture date, and pipeline notes per source.

